<title>USA: True North unit wins Kimberly contract.</title>
<headline>True North unit wins Kimberly contract.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>True North Communications Inc's Foote, Cone &amp; Belding said on Friday that it was named the agency of record for Kimberly-Clark Corp's consumer tissue division throughout the United Kingdom and Europe.</p>
<p>It said the account, covering Kleenex brand facial and bathroom tissue, has billings of $25 million.</p>
<p>J. Walter Thompson previously handled the account.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
